        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Keith Moon\n- Publications: Modern Drummer, Bookmarks, Rolling Stone\n- Music Works: Two Sides of the Moon\n- Organizations/Groups: The Who\n\nFacts:\n- Modern Drummer is a monthly publication targeting drummers and percussionists.\n- Bookmarks is a bimonthly American literary magazine for general readers, book groups, and librarians.\n- Keith Moon was posthumously inducted into the Modern Drummer Hall of Fame in 1982 as only the second rock drummer chosen.\n- Two Sides of the Moon is the debut and only solo album by Keith Moon, the drummer for the Who.\n- In 2011, Keith Moon was voted the second-greatest drummer in history in a Rolling Stone readers' poll.",
